amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/89ad2aaff090e802c116843f1fc89d5a.webm?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/89ad2aaff090e802c116843f1fc89d5a.mp4?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/91b4be79715ae7daf568fb850c4fa35a.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/91b4be79715ae7daf568fb850c4fa35a.webm?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>Boss Fights Worthy of a Young Deity</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/c446fdd303f9c37f58d030b4e1a2230e.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/c446fdd303f9c37f58d030b4e1a2230e.webm?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The platforming is punctuated with exhilarating boss battles which will test the son of Odin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each realm features a set of almighty adversaries who want to stop Thor on his way to becoming a true god. You will need to make use of everything you learned along the way to beat them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/dede55daf4e1226d0f6d0ce9e17484cf.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/dede55daf4e1226d0f6d0ce9e17484cf.webm?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/dede55daf4e1226d0f6d0ce9e17484cf.mp4?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/91b4be79715ae7daf568fb850c4fa35a.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/91b4be79715ae7daf568fb850c4fa35a.webm?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>Overview</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/c446fdd303f9c37f58d030b4e1a2230e.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/c446fdd303f9c37f58d030b4e1a2230e.webm?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.apng?t=1727774558\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Master <strong>ricocheting hammer</strong> throws to overwhelm enemies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.apng?t=1727774558\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Learn <strong>awesome special abilities</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.apng?t=1727774558\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Explore over 30 <strong>handcrafted levels</strong> across three distinct realms </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.apng?t=1727774558\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> <strong>Challenging boss fights</strong>, each with unique mechanics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.apng?t=1727774558\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Rattle your brain to solve tricky <strong>environmental puzzles</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.apng?t=1727774558\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Discover <strong>tons of secrets</strong> and collect hidden gems to unlock challenge levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.apng?t=1727774558\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Enjoy the <strong>story</strong> of a boy taking responsibility</p>",
    "short_description": "Jump into this challenging retro platformer! Play as Thor, use his mighty hammer and unique items to explore the Northern Realms. Beware of mythical creatures blocking your path to become a god!",
    "supported_languages": "English, German, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cIt is a masterpiece of pixel art that is sure to appeal to demanding gamers.\u201d<br>9.3 \u2013 Pixel-Magazin<br><br>\u201cTiny Thor is a blast from the past wrapped up in a new experience with its nostalgic-like gameplay!\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 GameTyrant<br><br>\u201cTiny Thor is a nostalgia-powered experience that takes the best ideas of classic action platformers and adds its own spin to them.\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 Softpedia<br>",
